# Both images build from the repository root. Local build output must stay out of the context: a
# host-restored obj/ copied over the image's own restore breaks `dotnet publish --no-restore`, and a
# host node_modules or .next would replace the one built for the image.
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.env
.env.dev
